# Rust TUI config for ~/.pi-python/config.toml
#
# Leave this file empty, or write only keys that the TUI knows.
# Python agent settings belong in agent.toml — NOT here.
#
# Top-level ``permission = "ask"`` will break TUI startup (the TUI expects a
# ``[permission]`` table, not a string). A ``[[models]]`` array and invalid TOML
# stop it too. Keys that the TUI does not know are ignored.
